  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### How can we select for the client to pay class 2 NIC voluntarily?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  3:37 PM\n\n\t\tThe 'auto calculate class 2 NIC' checkbox should be ticked by default, hence you cannot input the figure manually, please untick the checkbox at the '+supplementary form' (button) available on the top left-hand side and input the amount of class 2 NIC on the tax calculation summary page.\n\nClick here to watch how to voluntarily / manually calculate Class 2 NIC\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How can we select for the client to pay class 2 NIC voluntarily?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  3:37 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The 'auto calculate class 2 NIC' checkbox should be ticked by default, hence you cannot input the figure manually, please untick the checkbox at the '+supplementary form' (button) available on the top left-hand side and input the amount of class 2 NIC on the tax calculation summary page.</span></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/3601814040704887a1153ecc646b026e\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to voluntarily / manually calculate Class 2 NIC</span></strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074131339/original/7KYc_0FmMCOmuOIDCmzPg4pkgdNmfnUVmQ.png?1553521354\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074131339/original/7KYc_0FmMCOmuOIDCmzPg4pkgdNmfnUVmQ.png?1553521354\" data-fileid=\"9074131339\" data-uniquekey=\"1553521340123\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074131338/original/bfevUIp2_3UiGx36amdO8bT0MUd6oUB1PQ.png?1553521354\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074131338/original/bfevUIp2_3UiGx36amdO8bT0MUd6oUB1PQ.png?1553521354\" data-fileid=\"9074131338\" data-uniquekey=\"1553521340123\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165584\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165584/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165584\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165584/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165584\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-cont